["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1376: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin congenital syphilis Sokova (Zokova) turn wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-本土持续传播已成常态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>美國正式失去麻疹消除地位：本土持續傳播已成常態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泛美衛生組織確認美國本土麻疹已從「輸入性散發」變成「本土持續傳播」，每週新增病例超200例，而CDC一度拒絕及時公布死亡數據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frederick the Great | Extra History Complete | European History oblique attack pragmatic sanction Diplomatic Revolution of 1756\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-extracredits-被父亲虐待的王子长大后成了普鲁士最能打的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d280cab8b0804908-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">48:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>被父親虐待的王子長大後成了普魯士最能打的國王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弗里德里希大帝靠「誰先動手誰贏」和步兵的齊射隊形，把一個二流邊緣小國打成了能跟哈布斯堡叫板的強權，代價是七年戰爭幾乎把普魯士滅國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歐洲史</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事戰術</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"#37 Jacob Haqq-Misra - Future of Humanity, UAPs, Technogenic Gases technosignature Project Janus cooperative sovereignty morphological analysis Galileo Project\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-coolworldslab-研究者发现军方uap视频里的神秘飞行物-拍翅频率对上了鸟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4e1a5a8c3b40b506-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">CoolWorldsLab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>研究者發現軍方UAP視頻裡的神秘飛行物，拍翅頻率對上了鳥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一段被軍方作為UAP公開發布、時速480英里的六個編隊飛行物，經逐幀分析顯示約每秒7次的翼拍頻率，與鳥類拍翅節律一致，速度數字本身也只是地面視差。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SETI</span><span class=\"tag\">技術徵兆</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1115 - Nov 21 2026 regolith HVDC backbone eminent domain vermicompost\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-skeptics-美国再度失去麻疹消除资格-现任卫生部长本人在传播反疫苗言论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>美國再度失去麻疹消除資格：現任衛生部長本人在傳播反疫苗言論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國在2000年宣布消除麻疹後首次失去這一資格，而主管公共衛生的部長小羅伯特·肯尼迪一邊說去打疫苗，一邊不斷釋放「不用強制接種」的政治暗語，系統性瓦解了疫苗接種體系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">反疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Unicorns alicorn mille fleurs qilin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-stuffmissed-独角兽传说源于一头被糟糕翻译的驴-从波斯道听途说到欧洲圣物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">35:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>獨角獸傳說源於一頭被糟糕翻譯的驢：從波斯道聽途說到歐洲聖物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲中世紀獨角獸傳說幾乎全部可以追溯到公元前400年一位希臘醫生聽二手故事寫成的書，而所謂的獨角獸角，後來被證實大多是海里的敘角鯨牙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神話傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">中世紀藝術</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Camilla Cavendish on Why Falling Birth Rates Aren&#x27;t a Feminist Success Story heartache gap low fertility trap 4-2-1 problem relationship escalator situationship\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-goodfight-韩国每100人将只有12个孙辈-低生育率是组织问题-不是选择问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>韓國每100人將只有12個孫輩：低生育率是組織問題，不是選擇問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低生育率的真正瓶頸不是女性不想要孩子，而是「浪漫饑荒」讓異性找不到可靠伴侶，社會傳染又讓生育看起來比實際更不划算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人口結構</span><span class=\"tag\">生育率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Professional Network Built for You and Your AI Agent cosign FDE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-a16z-职场社交网络-cosign-让-ai-智能体替你找该认识的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>職場社交網絡 Cosign 讓 AI 智能體替你找該認識的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cosign 把專業網絡的信任憑證從簡歷變成「誰為你背書」，並開放給 AI 智能體每天自動掃描列表、尋找值得連接的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人才招聘</span><span class=\"tag\">專業社交網絡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Forcing China to Reshape Industrial Policy self-recursive improvement / RSI new quality productive forces\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-oddlots-北京逼着-ai-公司用华为芯片-哪怕这会让模型慢半拍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">45:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>北京逼著 AI 公司用華為芯片，哪怕這會讓模型慢半拍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國的產業政策邏輯是全棧自研供應鏈優先於當下追趕 AI 前沿，北京壓著公司少買 NVIDIA、多用華為，哪怕因此落後美國幾個月甚至更久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國產業政策</span><span class=\"tag\">華為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Spend the Lead on Safety: Biden AI Advisors Ben Buchanan &amp; Tantum Collins on the Fate of the World The Bitter Lesson spend the lead on safety closed-loop recursive self-improvement (RSI) compute overhang Bitter Temptation Mythos\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-cogrev-前白宫ai顾问-掐断中国算力不是打压-是为了换时间搞安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/289df85bdcb3f219-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>前白宮AI顧問：掐斷中國算力不是打壓，是為了換時間搞安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位前白宮AI顧問稱，對華芯片封鎖的目的不是遏制崛起，而是用算力優勢換取時間解決AI安全問題——但中方在日內瓦談判的開場回應只有一句「先賣芯片」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美AI競爭</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stress Physiology (YOUR BODY ON STRESS) with Rajita Sinha HPA axis adaptive stress response (ASR) feed forward interoception\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-ologies-你以为喝一杯能减压-其实酒精正在摧毁你感知压力的能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>你以為喝一杯能減壓，其實酒精正在摧毀你感知壓力的能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">酒精、大麻這類「減壓」手段會鈍化身體發出的壓力信號，導致基線壓力升高、需要攝入更多才能感到同樣的放鬆，這是一種自我強化的惡性循環。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">壓力生理學</span><span class=\"tag\">皮質醇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The puzzling story of human sleep cathemerality process S / process C sleep efficiency chronotype Epeme S.H.E.L.L.（shelter, hearth, environmental prep, lux, lookouts）\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-manyminds-人类是灵长类里睡得最少的物种-这是进化故意为之的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fe31650eb2d0a117-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">58:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Many Minds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>人類是靈長類裡睡得最少的物種，這是進化故意為之的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">跨文化比較顯示，無電力的狩獵採集者睡得更短、睡眠效率更低，卻自稱睡得很好——真正的差異不在睡眠時長，而在晝夜節律振幅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠科學</span><span class=\"tag\">進化人類學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic Goes Public, Nvidia in Crisis, Markets Tank, Open Source Crackdown? open weight RSI (recursive self-improvement) accretive\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-allin-查马斯预言ai只剩十家巨头-从矿产到应用全部通吃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83e57018bf31be4d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>查馬斯預言AI只剩十家巨頭：從礦產到應用全部通吃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic兩萬億上市當天，查馬斯提出未來只會有十家AI巨頭從挖礦到應用層垂直整合，不屬於這個陣營的現金牛公司將被市場無情拋售。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">Nvidia</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Adjusting for Credit Risk: Masters In Business with David Eichhorn LDI (Liability-Driven Investing) Portable Alpha Information Ratio Interval Fund PBGC (Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-mastersinbiz-固定收益行业的-阿尔法-剥开信用利差后大多只是贝塔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>固定收益行業的「阿爾法」，剝開信用利差後大多只是貝塔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NISA CEO 說，行業裡很多被叫作固定收益阿爾法的超額收益，迴歸信用市場後會大幅縮水，本質是長期超配信用利差的貝塔，而非真正的技能型收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">固定收益</span><span class=\"tag\">私募信貸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Agentic State agentic flooding MCP server\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-chinatalk-政府正被ai智能体洪水淹没-关门加验证码是最糟的应对方式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2cc67e8c35d3477b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>政府正被AI智能體洪水淹沒，關門加驗證碼是最糟的應對方式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當公民用ChatGPT和Claude批量提交FOIA申請、補助申請時，政府本能反應會是加驗證碼、堵流程，但真正該做的是重設服務，用agent自己接住這波需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GovTech</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fakeovers perp walk mention market sandwich attack fakeover\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-moneystuff-多数假收购骗局根本没打算赚钱-只是想体验一把谈并购的快感/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>多數假收購騙局根本沒打算賺錢，只是想體驗一把談併購的快感</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個英國人偽裝成美國口音的收購方，騙了CEO一場，股票買了卻忘發新聞稿沒賺到錢——法官報告說他只是享受扮演另一個角色。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">IPO定價</span><span class=\"tag\">預測市場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the Agent Era Needs a New Operating System | DHH Omachi Omicron Foundation vibe code pseudo-anonymous hacker\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-a16z-dhh说源代码护城河已经没了-谁还信就是在自欺欺人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>DHH說源代碼護城河已經沒了：誰還信就是在自欺欺人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DHH認為Agent讓軟件開發成本歸零，Mac和Windows的鼠標點擊式交互天生不適合Agent，而Linux歷史上被嫌棄的終端、配置文件、詳細報錯，恰好是Agent最愛的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Linux</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"368: Gut Bacteria and Vaccine Induced Fever MALDI-TOF calprotectin flagellin DOT-MGA essential agreement (EA)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-thisweekinmicr-疫苗接种后发烧-根源可能是你肠道里的一种细菌和加工食品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb4df99c03bbbeed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>疫苗接種後發燒，根源可能是你腸道里的一種細菌和加工食品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究發現愛吃西式加工食品的人腸道里鞭毛菌 Waltera 更多，鞭毛蛋白引發慢性腸道炎症，這讓他們打疫苗後更容易發燒——糞便移植到無菌小鼠身上也能復現這個效應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">腸道微生物組</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗反應原性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen’s Not Coming Back, Adventures in Agentic Commerce, Q&amp;A on United, GTA VI, iPhone Duo SKU EUV\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-sharptech-黄仁勋的真正罪名不是芯片流入中国-而是公开反对芯片禁令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳的真正罪名不是芯片流入中國，而是公開反對芯片禁令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達賣給Megaspeed供阿里巴巴用的芯片生意本來完全合法，真正讓黃仁勳出局的，是他在芯片禁令問題上和政府對著幹、拒絕像銀行一樣配合執法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Your Kid Doesn’t Need a “Thing” Yet. The Science of Late Specialization kind learning environment / wicked learning environment match quality paramecium principle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-raisinggh-顶尖运动员小时候很少是最强的-早专项反而是负向指标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c2fa69281802c1bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">39:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>頂尖運動員小時候很少是最強的，早專項反而是負向指標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一項針對近3萬名音樂家、科學家、運動員的研究發現，童年最優秀的人幾乎從不是成年後最優秀的人，早專項、早排名反而預示著更差的成年表現和更高的受傷率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年體育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is the Iran War good for the planet? Strait of Hormuz Strategic Petroleum Reserve petrostates vs electrostates permitting reform\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-grayarea-伊朗战争切断霍尔木兹两成石油-油价却没涨到200美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebbc73f24465a9d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>伊朗戰爭切斷霍爾木茲兩成石油，油價卻沒漲到200美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這場史上最大石油供應中斷本該把油價推到200美元，結果靠中國囤貨、沙特繞道管線和各國戰略儲備硬扛了過去，而真正傷到全球經濟的是柴油，不是汽油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源政策</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How an American AI Company Uses Chinese Open-Weight Models open weight obliterated model RL environment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-oddlots-美国ai创业公司私下都在用中国开源模型-只是不敢公开说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">48:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>美國AI創業公司私下都在用中國開源模型，只是不敢公開說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的護城河不是選哪個基礎模型，而是能不能用自己的數據把開源權重微調成比巨頭單次調用更便宜、更準的專用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">模型微調</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vasa: History&#x27;s Least Successful Warship broadside psychological safety\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-cautionary-瓦萨号沉没真相-不是国王瞎指挥-是没人敢说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">36:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>瓦薩號沉沒真相：不是國王瞎指揮，是沒人敢說真話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">瓦薩號首航十分鐘內傾覆，流傳百年的「國王瞎改設計」說法是神話，真正致命的是副將弗萊明明知船不安全，卻因為怕得罪國王而對這個致命問題保持沉默。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理安全感</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Joe Studwell on How Africa Works, and What It Tells Us About China developmental state performance legitimacy AGOA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-20-sinicapodcast-人口密度-不是腐败或民族冲突-才是非洲发展的天花板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1120</span></div>\n<h2>人口密度，不是腐敗或民族衝突，才是非洲發展的天花板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者放棄了腐敗、民族衝突這類主流解釋，論證說非洲獨立時人口密度不到每平方公里十人，這才是城市化、財政和基建長期起不來的根源，東亞模式的政策本身反而是通用的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">非洲發展</span><span class=\"tag\">東亞模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scaling Linear’s GTM to $100M ARR — Cristina Cordova, COO MCP SDR AE Forward Deployed Engineer Loops\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-19-latentspace-linear-coo自曝-企业级销售靠砍掉原定路线图-全力押注agent才追上来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4bdc663aa3f33e23-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1119</span></div>\n<h2>Linear COO自曝：企業級銷售靠砍掉原定路線圖，全力押注agent才追上來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Linear在2025年臨時放棄原定的企業級功能路線圖，轉去全力建MCP服務器和agent平臺，結果反而靠這個贏得了原計劃拿不到的大客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">GTM</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>"]